# Nashi, Searcher in the Dark: "Whenever Nashi deals combat damage to a player, you mill that many cards. You may put any number of
# legendary and/or enchantment cards from among them into your hand. If you put no cards into your hand this way, put a +1/+1
# counter on Nashi" (CR 510.2, 701.17a, 608.2d). Nashi hits for 2 on turn 3 and mills Moat (an enchantment) and Arabella (a
# legendary creature); Bot1 takes both, so no counter goes on and Nashi stays a 2/2. Dark Ritual is the next card, left unmilled.

